# Rock Hydra with 3 +1/+1 counters, made a 6/6 by Giant Growth, attacks and is blocked by two Grizzly Bears, whose 2 damage each
# is dealt to it at once (CR 510.2). Its counters prevent 1 damage each and are removed as they do (CR 615.1), so the second
# Bears' damage meets only the counter the first left: 3 damage prevented, the fourth dealt - a 3/3 with 1 damage and no
# counters. Its prevention is of damage to it alone: the Bears it deals damage to die. Then, with no counter left, its
# prevention doesn't apply at all: Bot2's Shock meets only the Hydra's {R} shield, so Bot1 is not asked to order the two (CR
# 616.1), and the shield prevents 1 and the other is dealt.
